<title>FRANCE: Three ships loading wheat in Rouen, two more due.</title>
<headline>Three ships loading wheat in Rouen, two more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three ships are loading a total of 46,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour is for export to Greece, Morocco and Tunisia, they said.</p>
<p>Two more ships are expected in port by February 10 to load 21,000 tonnes of wheat to unspecified destinations.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
